  "releaseNotes": "- Change global.json to use .NET 11.0 SDK (also update the github workflow to use .NET 11.0 SDK)\n            - Update Target Frameworks for core library SvgNet and unit tests project SvgNetUnitTests to include .NET 11.0 and .NET 11.0-windows\n            - Update Dependency\n            + Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk \"18.11.0\" -> \"18.11.1\"\n            + System.Drawing.Common \"10.0.14\" -> \"11.0.0\" (only when building for .NET 10.0 or .NET 11.0)\n            - Separate class SvgImageElement to its own file SvgImageElement.cs\n            - Small optimizations in SvgColor.cs: use Regex.IsMatch(s) instead of Regex.Match(s).Success in two places\n            - Change routine.bash to expand the aliases it was conditionally using to avoid dependency on the aliases being defined in the shell environment",
